"PulseFiles Help Shortcuts" = "Русский: Keyboard shortcuts:\n\n• Tab — Switch panes\n• Return — Open the selection, or rename/confirm text while editing\n• Backspace or Command-Up — Go to the parent folder\n• Command-[ or Command-] — Go back or forward\n• Command-Shift-G — Go to Folder\n• Command-N or Command-Shift-N — New folder or file\n• Command-C/X/V — Copy, cut, or paste with the clipboard\n• Command-Shift-. — Show or hide hidden files\n• Command-` — Toggle the Beta Terminal after enabling it in Settings\n• Command-Period — Cancel the active file operation\n\nOpen Settings to control the Beta Terminal and file-operation confirmations. Use folder pickers to grant PulseFiles access when macOS requires permission.";
"PulseFiles Help Shortcuts Debug" = "Русский: Keyboard shortcuts:\n\n• Tab — Switch panes\n• Return — Open the selection, or rename/confirm text while editing\n• Backspace or Command-Up — Go to the parent folder\n• Command-[ or Command-] — Go back or forward\n• Command-Shift-G — Go to Folder\n• Command-N or Command-Shift-N — New folder or file\n• Command-C/X/V — Copy, cut, or paste with the clipboard\n• Command-Shift-. — Show or hide hidden files\n• Command-` — Toggle the Beta Terminal after enabling it in Settings\n• Command-Period — Cancel the active file operation\n\nOpen Settings to control the Beta Terminal, file-operation confirmations, and Debug-only sandbox safeguards.";
